hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1114","Chapter: another case of preferment, 1153 - Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith narrated to us, he said: Ikrimah ibn Ammar narrated to us, he said: Iyas ibn Salamah ibn al-Akwa' narrated to me, he said: My father (may Allah be pleased with him) narrated to me, who said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: The best of our horsemen today is Abu Qatadah, and the best of our foot-soldiers is Salamah. Then he gave me two shares: the share of the horseman and the foot-soldier together."
